---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';

---
<Base page="privacy">
<Header current="" />
<header style="padding: clamp(48px, 7vw, 104px) clamp(20px, 4.5vw, 64px) 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 108px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.035em; ">Privacy.</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; max-width: 640px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB">The short version: I collect what you send me through a form, plus analytics about your visit. I never sell it.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #A5AAAF">This site, action.ceo, is run by Victor Gazio. Last updated Nov 18, 2026.</p>
</header>
<section class="rv" aria-label="Details" style="padding: 24px clamp(20px, 4.5vw, 64px) 110px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">Forms</h2>
<div style="flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB" set:html={`When you use the contact or booking form, I get your name, your email, your company or event if you add it, what you wrote and the type of request. I use it to reply. It is stored with Cloudflare, and I get a Telegram alert with your name and line 1 of your message. I never store your raw IP address, only a salted hash of it, so I can stop spam floods.`}></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">Spam check</h2>
<div style="flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB" set:html={`Forms use Cloudflare Turnstile to tell people from bots. Turnstile looks at signals from your browser to decide, without tracking you across sites.`}></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">Analytics</h2>
<div style="flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB" set:html={`The site uses Google Analytics 4 to count visits and see which pages get read: things like pages viewed, time on page, the site that sent you, your device type and your rough location from your IP address. If you are in the EU, the EEA, the UK or Switzerland, no analytics cookies are set until you say yes in the banner. Elsewhere, analytics is on by default.`}></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">Videos</h2>
<div style="flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB" set:html={`Videos play in YouTube's own player, and YouTube sets its own cookies when that player loads. In the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland the player loads only after you click the video. Elsewhere it loads with the page.`}></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">How I use it</h2>
<div style="flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB" set:html={`To reply to you, to send you what you asked for, to see which pages and videos are useful, to keep the site working and to protect it from abuse. I don't sell your information, and I don't use it for advertising.`}></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">Who sees it</h2>
<div style="flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB" set:html={`The services that run the site: Cloudflare (hosting, forms and the spam check), Google (Analytics and YouTube) and Telegram (my private alert). I may also share information if the law requires it, to prevent fraud or abuse, or to protect someone's rights or safety.`}></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">Cookies</h2>
<div style="flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB" set:html={`Cookies are only set by Google Analytics (with your consent where required) and by YouTube's player. You can block or delete cookies in your browser. The site still works without them; videos then open on YouTube.`}></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">Where it lives</h2>
<div style="flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB" set:html={`Form messages are stored and processed in the United States. I keep them only as long as I need them to reply and follow up. Ask me and I'll delete yours sooner.`}></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">Security</h2>
<div style="flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB" set:html={`I follow industry practice: encrypted connections, no raw IP addresses, and access limited to me. No system is 100% secure, so I can't promise absolute security.`}></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">Do Not Track</h2>
<div style="flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB" set:html={`The site doesn't respond to browser Do Not Track signals. The consent banner and your browser's cookie settings are how you control analytics.`}></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">Children</h2>
<div style="flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB" set:html={`This site is for a general audience. I don't knowingly collect information from anyone under 16. If you think a child sent me information, email me and I'll delete it.`}></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">Your rights</h2>
<div style="flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB" set:html={`You can ask what I hold about you, ask me to correct it or ask me to delete it. If you are in the EU, the EEA, the UK or Switzerland, you have these rights under the GDPR and UK GDPR, and I'll answer within 1 month. Email <a href="mailto:me@action.ceo" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #FFFFFF">me@action.ceo</a>.`}></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52; border-bottom: 1px solid #0A2C52;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">Changes</h2>
<div style="flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB" set:html={`If this policy changes, the date at the top changes too. Using the site after an update means you accept the new version.`}></div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
